From 4652834ff74a7fe0cc97ec2154ef0d3f8d6264ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 21:59:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] oem: arm: handle boot progress sensor events

Add Arm OEM handling for PHX BootProgressCode numeric sensor events
from the MCP. The handler consumes direct PLDM sensor events, filters
by the PHX terminus and boot progress sensor ID, and writes the decoded
presentReading payload to the OpenBMC Boot.Raw object.

Also update BootProgressLastUpdate with the current timestamp and set
BootProgress to the OEM progress stage.

The handler intentionally does not register for polled events because
boot-progress-codes are only handled from sensor event messages.

Tested:

$log-util list postcode
..
..
2026-04-30 07:45:32       0x00006000

